{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"e62308e5-2e6d-4753-a744-84583f2ba2b0","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the analytics events defined in **docs/EVENTS.md**:\n\n- **Registration screen** (`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`):\n  * Imported `../analytics.dart`.\n  * Added flags to fire events only once per screen visit.\n  * Captured `registration_email_started` and `registration_phone_started` on first edit of each field.\n  * Captured `loan_amount_changed` on slider drag end with the selected amount.\n  * Captured `terms_accepted` once when the user checks the checkbox.\n  * Captured `registration_continue_tapped` with `amount` and `terms` before navigating to offers.\n\n- **Offers screen** (`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`):\n  * Imported `../analytics.dart`.\n  * Wrapped the list in a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` to capture `offers_scrolled` with the scroll offset.\n\n**Applied parts of the colleague’s note**\n- Used once‑per‑screen flags for text fields.\n- Moved slider event from `onChanged` to `onChangeEnd`.\n- Used a scroll‑end listener instead of per‑pixel updates.\n- Preserved original event names and properties.\n","duration_seconds":486.050926,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":60324,"output_tokens":47056,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":1734080,"total_tokens":107380}}}
